OL,3,GNEWSAInjured Army veteran represents GB
OL,4,Aat golf in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn injured Army veteran has been chosen
OL,7,Fto represent Great Britain in a golf
OL,8,Fcompetition against the US.
OL,10,FThe Simpson Cup is an international
OL,11,Ftournament for wounded and injured
OL,12,Fmilitary veterans, taking place from
OL,13,FSunday at Shady Oaks Country Club in
OL,14,FTexas.
OL,16,FSteve Dickinson, 61, from Peterborough,
OL,17,Fneeded a complete knee replacement for
OL,18,Fan injury he got after serving with the
OL,19,FBritish Army in the first Gulf War in
OL,20,F1991.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
