OL,3,GNEWSAInjured Army veteran represents GB
OL,4,Aat golf in US
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe has been selected for the team for
OL,7,Fthe third consecutive time and said:
OL,8,F"Having served my country in uniform,
OL,9,Fbeing given the opportunity to
OL,10,Frepresent Great Britain again through
OL,11,Fsport is something I am immensely proud
OL,12,Fof."
